        <activityName xml:lang="en">Multicolumn radiator</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Multicolumn radiator
Production of a multicolumn radiator including thermostatic valve and mounting brackets or cantilevers;
UUID: 645740cd-04cc-32bd-a319-f5260713ada5
Materials used for the production. Energy use for the different production steps. Transport of raw materials to the plant.
Location: Data sources mainly from Switzerland. Process applicable in central European conditions.
Technology: Typical technology, materials and components used in radiator installations for heating systems in appartment and commercial buildings
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Manufacturer informations and literature data. Data of typical products used. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_645740cd-04cc-32bd-a319-f5260713ada5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
